/*
 * Implements validation and construction of array and slice compose values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - static array literals: [a, b, c]
 *   - slice literals inside copy contexts
 *   - static and dynamic slice allocation: [value ; size]
 *   - expansion of nested lists via ExpandValue
 *   - inference of element mutability and type unification
 *   - construction of ArrayType, SliceType, ArrayValue, SliceCtorValue, and
 *     ArrayAllocValue nodes
 *
 * The behavior depends on whether the validator is currently inside a copy
 * expression, as slice literals and dynamic allocations require a copy context.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::array
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/array.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-25
